.TH TARZIP 1 "DTar Manual"
.SH NAME
tarzip \- create a tarball with user-specified compression
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tarzip
<path> [compression] [output]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a tar archive from the specified file or directory using the specified compression (gzip, bzip2, or xz).
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I path
The file or directory to archive.
.TP
.I compression
The compression type: gzip, bzip2, or xz.
.TP
.I output
(Optional) Output tarball file name.